#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="java-spring"
DISPLAY_NAME="Java / Spring Boot"

DESCRIPTION:
Enterprise Java services with Spring Boot. REST APIs, batch jobs,
microservices. Maven or Gradle.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      Java 21 LTS
- Framework:     Spring Boot 3.x
- Build:         Maven (mvn) or Gradle 8.x
- Test:          JUnit 5 + Spring Boot Test + Mockito
- Lint:          Checkstyle + SpotBugs (or Spotless)
- Format:        Spotless (Google Java Format or project style)

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- Pin Java version in .java-version or pom.xml/build.gradle
